{"detail": {"templateUuid": "8a6de89a85a249dc8a9be50b1fa9eab3", "projectUuid": "c9c9305029344e129e21e3d1a0868463", "name": "琵琶行", "description": "《青衫夜宴》改编自白居易长诗《琵琶行》。\n\n唐元和年间，因直言获罪的白居易被贬江州。一个秋夜，他在江上偶闻琵琶声，循声遇见一位曾名动长安的琵琶女。她自幼入乐坊，凭一曲琵琶赢得满堂喝彩，却在岁月流转、家道飘零与新人辈出中，渐渐被繁华遗忘；而白居易也因几句“不合时宜”的真话，失去了长安与仕途。\n\n一曲终了，两个原本陌生的人，在江风与灯火之间听懂了彼此：盛名会散，故人会远，唯有那些未曾被说出口的失意，仍在命运深处回响。影片以当代影视语言重述《琵琶行》，在一场江上夜宴中，书写失落者彼此照见、彼此成全的瞬间。", "coverUrl": "/assets/e6a8ebdc222f644e.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/be3d01381b3540a49242f487db8b94c3/fda34368cd2ff07c5d3e9d25b3667cb6ea216ecb.mp4", "snapshotId": 42898, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 11584651, "ownerUuid": "be3d01381b3540a49242f487db8b94c3", "avatar": "/assets/870d1fd2d18f88f7.webp", "nickname": "176****7697", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 38, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年09月02日 17:25", "updateAt": "2026年09月03日 23:33", "publishAt": "2026年09月02日 17:25", "playCount": 1116, "viewCreationProcessCount": 394, "copyCanvasCount": 49, "shareCount": 13, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/8a6de89a85a249dc8a9be50b1fa9eab3.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 15, "edges": 0}}, "recommendList": []}